graph TD
    A([🎒 Start: Log In to Student Portal]) --> B[(ERP DB: Load Student Profile
GPA, Credits, Holds)]
    B --> C{Active Holds
or Blocks?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Display Hold Alert
Direct to Relevant Office]
    D --> Z1([⚠️ End: Registration Blocked])
    C -- No --> E[Browse Course Catalog
Filter by Dept, Level, Schedule]
    E --> F[(ERP DB: Fetch Real-Time
Course Seats & Schedule)]
    F --> G[View Course Details:
Credits, Instructor, Prereqs, Seats]
    G --> H{Add to
Wishlist/Cart?}
    H -- No --> E
    H -- Yes --> I[(ERP DB: Check Seat
Availability in Real-Time)]
    I --> J{Seat
Available?}
    J -- No --> K[Display: Course Full
Show Waitlist Option]
    K --> L{Join
Waitlist?}
    L -- No --> E
    L -- Yes --> M[(ERP DB: Add Student
to Waitlist Queue)]
    M --> E
    J -- Yes --> N[(ERP DB: Validate Prereqs
& Restrictions)]
    N --> O{Prereqs &
Rules Met?}
    O -- No --> P[Display Restriction Reason
e.g. Missing Prereq, Credit Limit]
    P --> Q{Submit
Petition?}
    Q -- No --> E
    Q -- Yes --> R[(ERP DB: Create Petition
& Route to Instructor/Advisor)]
    R --> E
    O -- Yes --> S[Confirm Course
Registration]
    S --> T[(ERP DB: Enroll Student
Decrement Seat Count)]
    T --> U[Display Updated
Registered Schedule]
    U --> V{Register
Another Course?}
    V -- Yes --> E
    V -- No --> W([✅ End: Registration Complete])